====Usage notes====
* One of the four [[w:is:Ri-sagnir|ri-verbs]] in Icelandic, the other being {{term|núa||to rub, massage; to wipe|lang=is}}, {{term|gróa||to grow; to heal|lang=is}} and {{term|róa||to row|lang=is}}.
* Even though some forms that include the letter {{term|e}} are pronounced as having an [[é]], the e-spelling is thought to be correct by the [[w:is:Menntamálaráðuneyti Íslands|Icelandic ministry of education]]. The preferred spelling of the [[first person]] [[singular]] [[past tense]] [[indicative]] form of the word ''snúa'' would thus be {{term|sneri||I turned|lang=is}} instead of {{term|snéri||I turned|lang=is}}, although both forms are used.

